            'Ten US states have signed plug-in solar laws as of October 2026: Utah, Maine, Virginia, Maryland, Colorado, Connecticut, New Hampshire, Vermont, New Jersey and California (pv magazine and state trackers). New York’s SUNNY Act passed the legislature in May 2026; as of a 16 November 2026 report, Governor Hochul had neither signed nor vetoed it.',
